//Spider Weaves His Web Easter Eggs

//Start Room Lever
"SC_Lever" "If you pulled this lever, would the entire cave fill up with sewage?  You sort of want to try it, don't you?"

//Rusted Control Panel
"SC_ControlPanel" "The panel is rusted and dirty.  You wonder just how soon before it'll become utterly useless."

//Gauges
"SC_Gauges" "These gauges haven't moved.  Is that a good sign?  Or a bad one?  What is Arachnos powering?"

//Wheel
"SC_Wheel" "This wheel is rusted to the point of uselessness.  It won't budge.  Why were you messing with it?"

//Computer 1
"SC_Computer1" "Most of the Arachnos in this lair have no idea what this is.  They think it looks like an alien computer from 'Outer Limits'."

//Computer 2
"SC_Computer2" "This is just as confusing to them as the first one.  They wonder what Recluse does with technology like this.  YOU wonder what Lord Recluse is planning for you!"

//Giant Red Liquid Tubes
"SC_RedLiquid" "You have no idea what the red liquid inside these monstrous tubes is.  You just hope that's not blood of people who failed Recluse's dedication trial."

//Final Room Computer 1
"SC_ComputerFinalRoom1" "You heard the Arachnos soldiers whispering that they have no idea what these crazy machines do.  You do, but it's not looking very promising so far."

//Final Room Computer 2
"SC_ComputerFinalRoom2" "This computer is beeping, but you have no idea how to stop it."